The first vendor solved `easy` exactly, so the harness correctly escalated to `medium` (`N=159`). This is still within both no-tool caps—319 answer characters and 276 intended operations—and the generator’s fixed witness construction remains unchanged.
diff --git a/gen_1402_1813.py b/gen_1402_1813.py
