codex
Outcome: `cap_bound` — retained, not shipped or rejected.

The native family implements Theorem 1.3’s planar list-coloring regime from the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/1402.1813). G1–G8 pass, including 0/200,000 guesses, six attacks at 0/8, and 100/100 canonical-key invariance checks.

The bare oracle loop solved:

- Easy: 3/3
- Medium: 1/3
- Hard: 2/3

The next level requires 352 answer elements, exceeding the 256-element cap. Therefore G9 hint/placebo arms were intentionally not run, as required for a bare-gate `cap_bound` result.

Files:

- [Generator](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1402.1813/gen_1402_1813.py)
- [README](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1402.1813/README.md)
- [Self-test report](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1402.1813/selftest_report.json)
- [Oracle transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1402.1813/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- [Harness metadata](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1402.1813/.meta.json)

No `REJECTED.md` was created.
